---
description: Storyblok block component conventions
globs: app/components/storyblok/**/*, .storyblok/**/*
alwaysApply: false
---
Component filenames match Storyblok block names exactly.
Every block root element uses v-editable="blok".
Use <StoryblokComponent> for nested blocks.
Use useAsyncStoryblok for page-level story fetching.
Block schemas live in .storyblok/components/ — repo is the source of truth, not the Storyblok UI.
